Name "Extract_From_lava"

--CTI简易熔岩提矿

--一阶段：熔岩->挥发性熔岩
--循环沙子供应到冶炼炉中产生熔融玻璃，实现再生苦力怕自动化产熔融玻璃之前使用
Every 2 seconds do

    Input minecraft:sand From Ingredients_Barrel Top side slots 0 
        if Smeltery has <= 1 minecraft:sand then                 
            Output minecraft:sand To Smeltery              
        End

End

--熔岩->挥发性熔岩+富炉渣块 每秒进行这一步的熔岩与熔融玻璃的输入
Every 2 seconds do

    Input fluid:minecraft:lava From Lava_Src 
        Output retain 32000 each fluid:minecraft:lava To each Fluid_Mixer Top side slots 0
    forget
    
    Input fluid:tconstruct:molten_glass From Molten_Glass_Src
        Output retain 16000 each fluid:tconstruct:molten_glass To each Fluid_Mixer Top side slots 1
    forget         

End

--产物的回收
Every 2 seconds do

    Input thermal:rich_slag_block From each Fluid_Mixer Top side slots 0
        Output thermal:rich_slag_block To Collecting_Barrel Top side slots 0

End

--二阶段：挥发性熔岩+石油焦粉->高密度熔岩+富集炉渣
--循环输入石油焦粉到一阶段热气动加工机中
Every 2 seconds do

    Input immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust From Ingredients_Barrel Top side slots 1 
        if each Process_Plant_P1 has <= 16 immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust then                 
            Output retain 8 each immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust To each Process_Plant_P1             
        End

End

--循环从液体混合器中抽取输入原料挥发性熔岩到一阶段热气动加工机中
Every 2 seconds do

    Input fluid:kubejs:volatile_lava From each Fluid_Mixer
        Output retain 16000 each fluid:kubejs:volatile_lava To each Process_Plant_P1

End

--产物的回收
Every 2 seconds do

    Input kubejs:enriched_slag From each Process_Plant_P1 Top side slots 1
        Output kubejs:enriched_slag To Collecting_Barrel Top side slots 1

End

--三阶段：高密度熔岩+石油焦粉
--循环输入石油焦粉到二阶段热气动加工机中
Every 2 seconds do

    Input immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust From Ingredients_Barrel Top side slots 1 
        if each Process_Plant_P2 has <= 16 immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust then                 
            Output retain 8 each immersivepetroleum:petcoke_dust To each Process_Plant_P2             
        End

End

--循环从一阶段热气动加工机中抽取输入原料高密度熔岩到二阶段热气动加工机中
Every 2 seconds do

    Input fluid:kubejs:dense_lava From each Process_Plant_P1
        Output retain 16000 each fluid:kubejs:dense_lava To each Process_Plant_P2

End

--产物与用尽熔岩的回收
Every 2 seconds do

    Input kubejs:dense_slag From each Process_Plant_P2 Top side slots 1
        Output kubejs:dense_slag To Collecting_Barrel Top side slots 2
    forget

    Input fluid:kubejs:used_lava From Process_Plant_P2 Top side slots 1
        Output fluid:kubejs:used_lava To Used_Lava_Collector Top side
    forget

End